          "heading": "Fiji Rugby confirm interest in recruiting Mark Nawaqanitawase for World Cup",
          "body": "Fiji Rugby has confirmed its interest in recruiting Mark Nawaqanitawase for the 2027 World Cup in Australia. Fiji are in Pool C there with Argentina, Canada and Spain, and the interest comes as Jake White, named from 31 applicants on Tuesday, prepares for his first match in charge, against Japan. The team are ranked 10th in the world, so every addition to the squad matters."
