          "heading": "Henry Arundell could feature this weekend as Bath's England hopefuls edge closer",
          "body": "Henry Arundell is closest to a comeback from Bath's injury list, with head of rugby Johann van Graan saying the England hopeful could even be in the mix this weekend. Arundell has missed the start of the campaign with a back issue. Fellow England hopefuls Will Muir, back in training after shoulder surgery, and Tom de Glanville, with a lower limb concern, have resumed parts of training, but there is no concrete return date for either, with availability assessed week by week."
