          "heading": "Dan Robson rates Maxime Lucu among world's best after 36-36 draw",
          "body": "Gloucester's Dan Robson has called Bordeaux-Bègles fly-half Maxime Lucu one of the best in the world, and described his 803 kicking metres as ridiculous. Robson, who spent a season with Pau in the Top 14, said the overriding feeling in the Gloucester huddle after the 36-36 draw was disappointment. Lucu, a France star, ran Bordeaux's game from fly-half, while Gloucester's scrum finished at 100 per cent success against 67."
