          "heading": "Will Greenwood suggests Farrell try Ciaran Frawley at inside centre",
          "body": "Will Greenwood, the 2003 England World Cup winner, suggests Andy Farrell pick Ciaran Frawley at inside centre alongside Sam Prendergast. Frawley, who left Leinster earlier this year for Connacht, has 15 Test caps, nearly all as a replacement. With Jack Crowley injured, he is now seen as a genuine rival to Sam Prendergast at 10. Farrell names his squad for the Argentina, Fiji and South Africa window today."
