          "heading": "Tavi Tuipulotu dreams of running out for Scotland after Glasgow debut try",
          "body": "Tavi Tuipulotu, brother of Scotland captain Sione and Edinburgh's Mosese, says he dreams of running out for Scotland himself. He marked his Glasgow debut with a try, and the episode, hosted by Andy Burke and Tom English, covers the chaos of growing up in the household. The episode also covers Glasgow's strong Champions Cup start. It is a useful bit of colour for a fan tracking the next Scotland squad."
